            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mevcut parola fonksiyonunu, <code>Logging in...</code> yazdırması için kayıtlı parolayla çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;party1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>checkPassword</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of a function",
            "id": 107899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>return</code> ifadesinin amacı nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir fonksiyondan değer döndürmek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Konsolda bir değeri görüntülemek</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Daha önce tanımlanmış bir fonksiyonu çağırmak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir fonksiyondan değer döndürmek.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon önce <code>console.log(price)</code>, sonra <code>return price - 5</code> çalıştırıyor.</p><p><code>20</code> geçiriyorsun. Çağıran taraf hangi değeri alır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hem <code>20</code> hem de <code>15</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Nothing gets executed",
            "id": 107900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir return ifadesi bir fonksiyondaki talimatlardan önce yerleştirildiğinde, fonksiyon çağrıldığında ne olur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">return ifadesinden sonraki talimatlar çalıştırılmaz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">return ifadesinden önceki talimatlar çalıştırılmaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon geçersiz ve hiç çalışmayacak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">return ifadesinden sonraki talimatlar çalıştırılmaz.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonda <code>return result;</code> satırından sonra <code>console.log(result);</code> bulunuyor. Çalıştığında konsola yazdırma satırına ne olur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyon zaten değer döndürdüğü için çalışmaz.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döndürülen değer geri gönderilmeden önce çalışır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonu geçersiz kılar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyon zaten değer döndürdüğü için çalışmaz.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple return statements",
            "id": 107901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda hangi return ifadesi veya ifadeleri çalışır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İlk return ifadesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İkinci return ifadesi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her iki return ifadesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İlk return ifadesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki <code>return</code> satırının yerini değiştirip çağrıyı aynı bırakıyorsun. Şimdi <code>result</code> değişkenine hangi değer atanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>39</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İki değer birleştirilir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>39</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return in if statements",
            "id": 107909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>With honors</code> mesajını, return ifadelerini doğru konuma yerleştirerek görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, ardından <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uygun bir not için <code>With honors</code>, yalnızca koşul sona erdikten sonra diğer mesajı döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return &quot;No honors&quot;;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, ardından <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Catch last case",
            "id": 107910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Doğru değeri kodlayarak son return ifadesini çalıştır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>400</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>375</code> altında <code>Too cold</code>, <code>425</code> üzerinde ise <code>Too hot</code> döndür.</p><p>İki karşılaştırmayı da tamamla ve <code>Just right</code> döndüren bir girdi seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>&lt;</code>, ardından <code>&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>400</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
